      "outcome": "A zero total still requires acknowledgment but no mana; a casting/activation mana window depends on the locked final total and precedes any cost payment."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://apps.magicjudges.org/forum/topic/42243/?page=1",
      "author": "Nathan Long, Magic Rules NetRep",
      "published": "2018-03-26",
      "outcome": "Primary rules answer confirms that casting a zero-cost Mox does not open the casting mana-ability window. Current CR text was checked independently."
    }
  ],
  "repair": [
    "FundingGoal::requires_mana reads all six required mana components and generic total; printed mana_component, source presence and current pool shortfall do not decide the window.",
    "FundingState::mana_window_open combines that positive total with the existing closed-cost phase. One mana_moves gate covers ordinary, deferred and complete-proposal searches; actual visit_cost_payment uses it before deferred indexed actions too.",
    "Private CostContext retains Announcement.cast_costs.mana_closed. Fresh standalone contexts begin open; current/overwritten craft, symbol and optional-cost contexts preserve the inherited phase. The query memo key includes its derived window bit.",
    "PayCosts acknowledgment and nonmana/contributor choices remain separate from mana activations. Already funded positive costs and positive totals later paid entirely by Convoke/Delve keep their initial window.",
    "Explicit resolution requests inspect all hybrid alternatives for a positive mana option, and establish their own request context independently of a suspended announcement.",
    "Priority action visitation is unchanged; basic, native intrinsic, granted and explicit-zero mana abilities remain available at priority. A zero-cost mana ability itself cannot open a nested zero-cost payment window."
  ],
  "caller_audit": {
    "FundingState::moves": "ordinary proposal reachability; requires positive final goal",
    "FundingState::deferred_moves": "nested proposal reachability; same predicate",
    "FundingState::action_moves": "actual guided payment actions; same predicate",
    "visit_cost_payment": "emits nonmana/acknowledgment options first, then rejects zero before both ordinary and indexed deferred mana paths",
    "visit_face_up_payment": "zero PayFaceUp acknowledgment retained; no mana moves for zero request",
    "visit_plot_payment": "zero PayPlot acknowledgment retained; no mana moves for zero request",
    "visit_resolution_payment": "checks all hybrid alternatives; no zero-only window; positive alternative opens a request window even if zero option chosen later",
    "prepare_mana_allocations": "reuses only already validated actual mana actions through same action_moves",
    "fund_creature_counter_cost": "counter-cost proposal walks ordinary/deferred moves through same gate",
    "visit_attack_tax_payment": "zero PayAttackTax acknowledgment retained; no zero mana window",
    "Priority visitation": "separate basic/intrinsic/granted/borrowed/self-granted emitters; unchanged; their own zero payment completion remains valid"
  },
